// @description  MusangForTdss · 土豆史诗（bilibili toy potatoepic）：实体透视 ESP、平滑自瞄、扳机、反作弊上报屏蔽、娱乐模块、Musang M3 ClickGUI
// @author       小猫弟
// @match        https://www.bilibilitoy.com/toy/potatoepic/*
// @match        file:///*
// @updateURL    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MusangOpen/MusangForTdss/main/MusangForTdss.user.js
// @downloadURL  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MusangOpen/MusangForTdss/main/MusangForTdss.user.js
